{"id":"e1467c63487fb5aa","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-deduction-theorem.md","title":"Deduction Theorem","display":"thm-deduction-theorem — Deduction Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-deduction-theorem","aliases":["57-thm-deduction-theorem"],"display":"thm-deduction-theorem — Deduction Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]","[[57-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-deduction-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-deduction-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-deduction-theorem — Deduction Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Deduction-Theorem\">Deduction Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_H\">\\(\\vdash_H\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a> 的公理及泛化侧条件；证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\varphi\\vdash_H\\psi\">\\(\\Gamma,\\varphi\\vdash_H\\psi\\)</span> 时，泛化变量必须不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\})\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_H\\psi\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_H(\\varphi\\to\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_H\\psi\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_H(\\varphi\\to\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按左侧证明长度归纳；泛化步骤使用已经列入 Hilbert 公理的量词移出条件。反向用命题肯定前件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Deduction-Theorem","text":"Deduction Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-hilbert-derivable","status":"resolved","id":"52897755c29c065c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，见 [[57-df-sentence]]。$\\vdash_H$ 采用 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的公理及泛化侧条件；证明 $\\Gamma,\\varphi\\vdash_H\\psi$ 时，泛化变量必须不属于 $\\mathrm{FV}(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\varphi\\})$。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-hilbert-derivable","status":"resolved","id":"5289